### 5.4 Recursive Text Splitter for RAG
Implemented in [[src/lib/rag/chunker.ts](file:///c:/Users/lenov/OneDrive/Desktop/HARSHIT/Projects/Agent%20Baymax/src/lib/rag/chunker.ts)]:
- Splits continuous document text into chunks of target size $1000$ characters with $200$ characters overlap.
- Looks backwards from chunk boundaries for natural breaking points:
  1. Period and space (`. `) occurring after the midpoint of the search window.
  2. Space (` `) to avoid cutting words in half.
- Preserves full sentences and contextual continuity for vector embedding generation.

